//
// The data passes pipeline/verify_data.py before any of this is generated:
// the two BetterGov exports agree on every shared field, awards never exceed the
// approved budget, the procurement timeline is correctly ordered, and a sampled
// Notice of Award PDF matched its row to the centavo.

